## Behavior (per PLAN §9 T15)
- Signature authenticates Slack, not the human: `SLACK_APPROVERS`
  (comma-separated user ids) gates every click; empty/unset = nobody.
- Non-allowlisted user → ephemeral "not on the approver list", no run.
- Button value is a pointer, re-resolved via `isPending`; replayed click
  on a resolved card starts nothing.
- Bad signature → 401; approve dispatches; reject records rejection and
  starts no container; `buildApprovalBlocks` renders the exact structured
  input with pointer-valued Approve/Reject buttons.

## Test command
- `npx vitest run test/slack-approval.test.ts`

